\pard\plain \ltrch\loch {\f0\fs24\b0 T}{\f0\fs24\b0 he Technology Migration Engine is a software developed to transform Perl Catalyst MVC controllers into Java Spring MVC controllers. This is done using both traditional transpilation methods to handle repetitive structural syntax, as well as LLMs for syntax that requires flexibility. The resulting software strikes the perfect balance between implementation complexity and quality of output. Overall, integrating LLMs within a controlled framework is an innovative way to harness their generative benefits without the risk of hallucination and fault.}{ }}